# rusty-sock users: one `username:argon2id-hash` entry per line.
#
# Manage entries with the built-in command (prompts for the password twice):
#   sudo rusty-sock user create alice
#   sudo rusty-sock user update alice
#   sudo rusty-sock user delete alice
#   sudo rusty-sock user list
# Add --restart to apply the change to a running service immediately.
#
# Keep this file root-owned with mode 0600; the service reads it through
# systemd's LoadCredential. Changes take effect when the service restarts.
